{#- Real project photographs, deliberately uncaptioned.

    Nobody has yet told us what each of these jobs was called, when it was done
    or where it was, and a made-up caption sitting on a real customer's house is
    not a small mistake. So the alt text describes what is visible in the frame
    and claims nothing beyond it. Captions get added when Kevin supplies them,
    not before.

    Context: workItems (optional) to render a subset. -#}
{%- set items = workItems if workItems else tps.work -%}
{%- if items.length %}
<ul class="work-grid" data-reveal-group>
  {%- for w in items %}
  <li class="work-grid__item" data-reveal>
    {% image w.image, w.alt, "(min-width: 1040px) 33vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" %}
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endif %}
